            "review_title": "Review at Xoi Ba Thao Bistro",
            "review_text": "Henk de B.\nNew York City, New York33 contributions\n0\nTasty hidden gem\nNov 2018 • Couples\nMy girlfriend, who grew up in Hanoi, brought me here our first night for a snack. I had the crab pate with sticky rice and soy sauce. It was very tasty and the whole trip I was nagging her to go back to have a snack from this place. I highly recommend giving this place a try\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 6, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
