            "review_title": "Review at Xoi Ba Thao Bistro",
            "review_text": "Pohyeeeeee\n32 contributions\n0\nGood sticky rice\nSep 2018 • Friends\nThey sell only xoi (sticky rice) and one could pick any topping from the stall. The owner is a grandma who doesn't speak any English but she is very nice and helpful. The sticky rice comes in two sizes: small (like a hamburger box) and big (like hamburger box x2). We picked 3 toppings like deep fried egg, fish cake and pork fillet. It costs about 36K. The sticky rice is very aromatic and filling. The grandma helped to cut all the topping into smaller pieces so it's easier for us to share the food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 1, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
